  "decisions": [
    "Employees book primary orders in SFA; distributors manage orders separately.",
    "Reuse existing Product, Retailer, Sales Order, Order Item, Scheme and secondary Product Return objects.",
    "Do not repurpose Distributor__c, which is the legacy Sales Representative object.",
    "No business records, example prices or outlet ownership are invented."
